{"id":"fbc035f3a4de1bd1","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_S303Conseq.md","title":"S303Conseq","display":"S303Conseq","type":"system","metadata":{"tags":["ZFC","normative-formula"],"macro_name":"S303Conseq","parameters":["g","e"],"formula_kind":"relational_abbreviation"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"tags","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>ZFC</span><span>normative-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"macro_name","html":"S303Conseq"},{"key":"parameters","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>g</span><span>e</span></div>"},{"key":"formula_kind","html":"relational_abbreviation"}],"html":"\n<p>定义组：编号入口固定参数。有序参数：<code>g</code>、<code>e</code>。</p>\n<p>固定入口参数；其余参数沿被调用定义的顺序。</p>\n<h2 id=\"规范公式\">规范公式</h2>\n<p><code>(@ S303Conseq g e)</code> 按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f625c6fc1945e22e\" href=\"?note=f625c6fc1945e22e\" title=\"000_ZFC/01_language\">无捕获缩写规则</a> 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-zfc\">(exists r (and (@ Num0 r) (@ NConseq r g e)))\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"直接依赖\">直接依赖</h2>\n<p><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"877a0a4748396497\" href=\"?note=877a0a4748396497\" title=\"ZFC_NConseq\">NConseq</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e8cec2782b4668b5\" href=\"?note=e8cec2782b4668b5\" title=\"ZFC_Num0\">Num0</a></p>\n<h2 id=\"证明状态\">证明状态</h2>\n<p>本页只定义缩写，不声称其一般元理论性质已经获得内核证明。 语言闭包检查与数学正确性验收的区别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"593f9bdab4d60707\" href=\"?note=593f9bdab4d60707\" title=\"000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务\">000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"规范公式","text":"规范公式","level":2},{"id":"直接依赖","text":"直接依赖","level":2},{"id":"证明状态","text":"证明状态","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"000_ZFC/01_language","status":"resolved","id":"f625c6fc1945e22e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"规范公式","excerpt":"`(@ S303Conseq g e)` 按 [[000_ZFC/01_language|无捕获缩写规则]] 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_NConseq","status":"resolved","id":"877a0a4748396497","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_NConseq|NConseq]]；[[ZFC_Num0|Num0]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_Num0","status":"resolved","id":"e8cec2782b4668b5","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_NConseq|NConseq]]；[[ZFC_Num0|Num0]]","embed":false},{"target":"000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务","status":"resolved","id":"593f9bdab4d60707","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"证明状态","excerpt":"本页只定义缩写，不声称其一般元理论性质已经获得内核证明。 语言闭包检查与数学正确性验收的区别见 [[000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务]]。","embed":false}],"math":[],"bytes":779,"backlinks":[{"id":"123c0b237d7b0c5a","anchor":"ref-793","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[规范公式/ZFC_S303Conseq|S303Conseq]]"},{"id":"095c8f460134f37c","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_S303Conseq|S303Conseq]]"}],"outgoing":["f625c6fc1945e22e","877a0a4748396497","e8cec2782b4668b5","593f9bdab4d60707"]}